	(text "EXC_A: PROBE_EXC (GPIO11) through 10k. SNS_A -> 10k -> gate; 1M pull-down sets the trip point,\n10 nF filters RF / splashes. Dry: open circuit, 0 A. Wet: Vg = 3.3 V * 1M / (1M + Rw + 20k) > Vth\n-> LEAK_A_N low -> EXT1 wake. Trip Rw ~ 1.3-4 MOhm (AO3400A Vth 0.65-1.45 V).\nMax DC through water 3.3 uA; firmware then drops PROBE_EXC and pulses it 5 ms every 10 s."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 13.97 71.12 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "3dbe2010-280b-56df-8b04-d9d9643744e2")
	)
